<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Zambia to privatise tourist lodges.</title>
<headline>Zambia to privatise tourist lodges.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Zambia Privatisation Agency said on Thursday that it would shortly be offering long-term operating leases on various lodges and campsites in the country's national parks and other tourist venues.</p>
<p>The agency said in an advertisement in the South African press that tenders would be invited from late April and completion of the sales was expected by September or October 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
